---
// Çocuk İşitme Testi — /degerlendirme/cocuk-isitme-testi. Fourth page of
// the "Değerlendirme" series (see header.data.ts's servicesMega first
// column), following Ücretsiz İşitme Testi, Odyometri and Timpanometri.
// Same clinical service-page genre and full health-content safety
// discipline, with extra care given the pediatric subject:
// developmental-milestone language is hedged throughout (every child
// develops differently, illustrative examples rather than a checklist),
// and parents are directed to a professional rather than a
// self-assessment at every turn.
//
// This is the one Değerlendirme page where a themed hero image is
// genuinely accurate rather than merely illustrative — it uses a real
// pediatric model (Oticon Play PX, tagged "Çocuk" in its own models.ts)
// instead of a generic device.
//
// The TechEvolution "stage" slot is repurposed as a genuine age-based
// method ladder (yenidoğan -> bebeklik -> erken çocukluk -> okul çağı),
// distinct from the process-step usage on the three prior pages, since
// pediatric testing genuinely changes method by developmental stage.
// The KulakArkasiComparison table contrasts objective testing (OAE/ABR)
// against behavioral testing (oyun odyometrisi) — pediatric audiology's
// own fundamental methodological split.
//
// accentColor: turuncu / orange-500 (#f97316) — fourth color in the
// fresh accent rotation opened for this series on Ücretsiz İşitme
// Testi's hero.ts; see that file for the full rationale.
//
// 14-section flow, in order: Hero -> Nedir? + Neden Önemlidir? ->
// Değerlendirme Önerilen Durumlar -> Avantajları -> Dikkat Edilmesi
// Gerekenler -> Yaşa Göre Test Yöntemleri -> Kullanılan Yöntemler ->
// Teknolojiler -> Markalara Göre İnceleyin -> Objektif vs Davranışsal
// Testler -> Uzman Yorumu -> SSS -> Premium CTA -> İlgili İçerikler.
import MainLayout from "../../layouts/MainLayout.astro";
import BrandPageHero from "../../components/brand-page/BrandPageHero/BrandPageHero.astro";
